{"id":"n89192-4-5","stage":4,"title":"흐릿하다 · 混","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89192-4-5-1","ko":"흐릿했던 강이 많이 깨끗해졌어요.","zh":"原本浑浊的江水变得干净多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"흐릿했던","meaning":"混，浑浊","explanation":"흐릿하다：混，浑浊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"흐릿하다","audio":"/audio/ee43dc526d3805c05481.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89192","senseId":"4","lemma":"흐릿하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흐릿했던","audio":"/audio/e885e22a2d0998b12d69.mp3"}},{"text":"강이","meaning":"江，河","explanation":"강：江，河；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"강","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30203","senseId":"1","lemma":"강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강이","audio":"/audio/bb997d3965c7f2634cdb.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"깨끗해졌어요.","meaning":"洁净，干净；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"깨끗하다：洁净，干净；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"깨끗하다","audio":"/audio/653161c326427f17a781.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60323","senseId":"1","lemma":"깨끗하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깨끗해졌어요","audio":"/audio/b9d87aa20f57e2607c98.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ee43dc526d3805c0","term":"흐릿하다","zh":"混，浑浊","audio":"/audio/ee43dc526d3805c05481.mp3","entryId":"89192","definition":"不干净，污浊。","pronunciation":["흐리타다"]},{"id":"d90ed2084b71f17c","term":"강","zh":"江，河","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3","entryId":"30203","definition":"又宽又长、最后流入大海的水流。","pronunciation":["강"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"653161c326427f17","term":"깨끗하다","zh":"洁净，干净","audio":"/audio/653161c326427f17a781.mp3","entryId":"60323","definition":"事物不脏。","pronunciation":["깨끄타다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c239ec95ad804c3f2a63.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89192-4-5-2","ko":"그러게요. 물고기들도 제법 보이네요.","zh":"是啊，也能看到不少鱼了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게요.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게요","audio":"/audio/cd2f15cf7e4066dccc42.mp3"}},{"text":"물고기들도","meaning":"鱼","explanation":"물고기：鱼；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"물고기","audio":"/audio/83844ff2a2ce50f87e1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56181","senseId":"1","lemma":"물고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물고기들도","audio":"/audio/85ee173663d98398d9cc.mp3"}},{"text":"제법","meaning":"够","explanation":"제법：够","readings":[{"term":"제법","audio":"/audio/2dd12f33392118c4b31a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31789","senseId":"1","lemma":"제법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제법","audio":"/audio/2dd12f33392118c4b31a.mp3"}},{"text":"보이네요.","meaning":"让看见","explanation":"보이다：让看见；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"1","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이네요","audio":"/audio/46898c8efbf3b62488a4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"i